    "body": "The age review detail panel currently shows raw npub and hex pubkey for the flagged user and reporter. The `UserIdentifier` component already exists and resolves kind 0 profiles (display name, NIP-05, avatar, profile link).\n\n**Current:** raw npub + hex copy button\n**Expected:** avatar, display name, NIP-05, npub with copy -- same treatment as banned user cards and report views\n\nSwap in `UserIdentifier` (block variant with avatar) for the flagged user, and `UserIdentifier` (compact/inline) for the reporter pubkey in `AgeReviewDetail.tsx`.\n\nParent: divinevideo/support-trust-safety#138",
